<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7347] Warning about page eviction, when persistence for different data region is enabled</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7347</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Consider the following configuration:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&amp;lt;property name=&quot;dataStorageConfiguration&quot;&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.ignite.configuration.DataStorageConfiguration&quot;&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;property name=&quot;dataRegionConfigurations&quot;&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;array&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.ignite.configuration.DataRegionConfiguration&quot;&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;name&quot; value=&quot;A_Region&quot;/&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;initialSize&quot; value=&quot;#{2L * 1024L * 1024L * 1024L}&quot;/&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;maxSize&quot; value=&quot;#{4L * 1024L * 1024L * 1024L}&quot;/&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;pageEvictionMode&quot; value=&quot;DISABLED&quot;/&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;persistenceEnabled&quot; value=&quot;true&quot;/&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;/bean&amp;gt;

                &amp;lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.ignite.configuration.DataRegionConfiguration&quot;&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;name&quot; value=&quot;B_Region&quot;/&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;initialSize&quot; value=&quot;#{2L * 1024L * 1024L * 1024L}&quot;/&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;maxSize&quot; value=&quot;#{4L * 1024L * 1024L * 1024L}&quot;/&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;pageEvictionMode&quot; value=&quot;RANDOM_2_LRU&quot;/&amp;gt;
                    &amp;lt;property name=&quot;persistenceEnabled&quot; value=&quot;false&quot;/&amp;gt;
                &amp;lt;/bean&amp;gt;
            &amp;lt;/array&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;/property&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/bean&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/property&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;property name=&quot;cacheConfiguration&quot;&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.ignite.configuration.CacheConfiguration&quot;&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;property name=&quot;name&quot; value=&quot;cache&quot;/&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;property name=&quot;dataRegionName&quot; value=&quot;B_Region&quot;/&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/bean&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/property&amp;gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It leads to the following warning on start: &lt;b&gt;Page eviction mode for [B_Region] memory region is ignored because Ignite Native Persistence is enabled&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But page eviction is actually applied and work as expected.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
