                            <comment id="16457684" author="ivan.glukos" created="Sat, 28 Apr 2018 16:15:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Makes sense. Please proceed to merge.&lt;br/&gt;
Minor note: we should wrap two-liners into code block, like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;        if (regCfg.getPageEvictionMode() != DataPageEvictionMode.DISABLED) {
            U.warn(log, &quot;Page eviction mode set for [&quot; + regCfg.getName() + &quot;] data will have no effect&quot; +
                &quot; because the oldest pages are evicted automatically if Ignite persistence is enabled.&quot;);
        }
&lt;/pre&gt;
